                    coach_intro:            `Ninety days. A capped A$3M. An inquiry into your “punitive and ineffective” compliance, a pensioner wrongly fined and a hardship family disconnected in a 39°C heatwave. You will not fine your way out of this — the fines are what caused it. Diagnose why customers break the rules before you design anything, match the nudge to who can and can’t comply, test it with a real counterfactual, and stay the right side of the line between a legitimate nudge and disguised coercion. Show us behaviour beats enforcement — with evidence.`,

